title: Dawid Bronicki
is-pinned-card: true
tags: advisor, centrist
card-image: img/portraits/Dawid.webp
view-if: bronicki_advisor = 1
new-page: true 

= Dawid Bronicki

Bronicki is the founder and the de facto head of the R. Gang, and is the unifying figure of the party.

- @coalition
- @snap_election
- @root: Return to main

@coalition
title: Negotiating with the Coalition
subtitle: Bronicki can improve our relationships with our coalition partners.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0 and spd_in_government = 1
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?][? if not spd_in_government: The R. Gang is not in government. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; coalition_dissent -= 1 if spd_in_government = 1 and coalition_dissent > 0; z_relation += 5; ddp_relation += 5; dvp_relation += 5

We have improved our relations with the Z, [+ ddp_name +], and DVP, and reduced tensions within the coalition.


@snap_election
title: Snap Election
subtitle: Call a snap election.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if chancellor != "Bronicki" : Bronicki must be Chancellor. ?][? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
choose-if: advisor_action_timer == 0 and chancellor == "Bronicki"
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; next_election_time = time + 3 if next_election_time > time+3; next_election_month = month + 3 if next_election_time >= time+3; next_election_year = year if next_election_time >= time+3; next_election_year += 1 if next_election_month > 12; next_election_month -= 12 if next_election_month > 12;

We have called for new elections, set for [+ next_election_month : month +] [+ next_election_year +].
